{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"29ff7ec2918e7fb3b70bc1751bcc4f6a1e5fa37662646d999a6729e1c83f66a1","ja":"赤巻紙青巻紙黄巻紙！\nとなりの客はよく柿食う客だ！","zh":"红卷纸青卷纸黄卷纸！\n隔壁的客人是真能吃柿子的客人！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"05f0a1db7598613298be73e6e706c4c84fc54f15214ecd090cb71fa0365cb73a","ja":"ぱちぱちぱち……ジュリアさん、パーフェクトです！\nこれなら、どんなお題が出ても大丈夫そうですね。","zh":"啪啪啪……茱莉亚先生，太完美了！\n这样的话，感觉无论出什么题目都没问题呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6e20e593f0ae5d12759076462fb63f3e3fce74705c1301b1fb6ce19956ca3578","ja":"ふふん、あのWEB番組の後、\nけっこう練習してたからな♪","zh":"哼哼，毕竟在那个网络节目之后，\n我可是练了很久的呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0d200238e6fd24d53665475feece53312b93a3e5335c8e002a981872cb00fd44","ja":"え～っと、赤パジャマに、黄パジャマ～、\n茶パパジャ……うーん、うまく言えないわね～。","zh":"嗯——红睡衣、黄睡衣～、\n茶睡睡……唔，念不顺畅呢～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"bdba5cd1c0f40ff8e1869747d02b379849948eb7c45702ed4ff461ef0c3abeb9","ja":"杏奈も……やって、みる……。\n除雪車……除雪……しゃ、作業、中……あぅ。","zh":"杏奈也……想试、试看……。\n扫雪车……扫雪……车、作业、中……呜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"159d52219c73914664adc433975924f1b750d617d6a206e77b502485b5a7c539","ja":"ジュリアちゃんみたいにいかないわね～。でも\n時間はあるから、みんなで頑張って練習しましょう♪","zh":"没法像茱莉亚那样顺利呢～。不过\n时间还很充裕，大家一起努力练习吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"325f6b8af78f3c9cb8f7cf9f8921d2abf9ee8ccc7896cd0c0742580ec460e37a","ja":"そして、『アイドル対抗早口言葉大会』本番当日……","zh":"然后，到了“偶像对抗绕口令大赛”正式演出当天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"0400d546dca0bb2fc15c0d8d75b5ee875c9a21677b07fc6c9651f6448d7f6152","ja":"今日の大会にはたくさんのアイドルが\n出場するみたいです……手ごわそうだぞ。","zh":"今天的比赛好像有很多偶像\n都会出场……感觉很难对付啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"3378526483f558b533df569726cc76ded2b983e0d52821ae8c2db456ad24b9cd","ja":"杏奈……できるだけ……残れたら、いいな……。","zh":"杏奈……要是能……尽可能留下来……就好了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"751cfdc43168057ede22cf3a94e28856dfb8c93c79aaf39a21550f772a4d6215","ja":"私はジュリアさんと同じく、優勝を狙います。\n……大きく出てみたぞ。","zh":"我和茱莉亚一样，目标是获得优胜。\n……话说得有点满呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"a9fd017d5389f2bcfe97d8eb4cd0d57938f3f9555360508666d606da617516e0","ja":"うふふ、優勝するにはジュリアちゃんに\n勝たないといけないけど、大変そうね。","zh":"呵呵呵，要拿冠军的话就必须战胜\n茱莉亚，不过感觉会很难呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1123.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"db4e44aae9754f2eb39624064d82af36d8b7d54943fe1ff62e95d8a67c1dfacf","ja":"悪いがどんな相手にも負けるわけにはいかないんだ！\n絶対優勝してみせるぜ！","zh":"抱歉，但无论对手是谁我都绝不能输！\n我一定会拿下冠军的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
